# Agent parity

`AGENTS.md` is canonical; the root compatibility files must be aliases to it. `.cursor/skills/` is canonical for shared skills and `.codex/skills/` is an identical mirror.

After changing an agent-related file, run:

```bash
pnpm run agent:sync-parity
pnpm run agent:check-parity
```
